ge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 第三紀元是持久協作者，產品週期只有三個月 OpenAI 產品負責人 Tara Seshan 斷言，AI 產品正從聊天、代理走向持久協作者，構建必須按兩到三個月的模型能力設計；未來工作是掌舵而非划槳，寫作即思考永不上自動化。 Lenny&#x27;s Podcast Lenny&#x27;s Podcast AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) 產品週期 持久協作者 Codex 寫作即思考 產品營銷契合 persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三紀元是持久協作者-產品週期只有三個月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三紀元是持久協作者，產品週期只有三個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 產品負責人 Tara Seshan 斷言，AI 產品正從聊天、代理走向持久協作者，構建必須按兩到三個月的模型能力設計；未來工作是掌舵而非划槳，寫作即思考永不上自動化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品週期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久協作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI 盈利是泡沫：成本後置，利潤前置 AI 基建的利潤當下兌現，成本卻攤銷到未來，這構成盈利泡沫。股市會先於盈利見頂，投資者應警惕而非追逐。 Excess Returns Excess Returns The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble AI泡沫 盈利質量 槓桿ETF 黃金 貿易政策 Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本後置-利潤前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</sp